OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Bradford City chairman
OL,4,ARichmond, 85, dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former chairman of Bradford City,
OL,7,FGeoffrey Richmond, has died at the age
OL,8,Fof 85.
OL,10,FRichmond helped oversee the Bantams'
OL,11,Fpromotion to the Premier League in
OL,12,F1999, marking the first time the club
OL,13,Fhad played in the top flight for 77
OL,14,Fyears.
OL,16,FAnnouncing his death on Sunday, the
OL,17,Fclub said Richmond had also "played an
OL,18,Fimportant role in the redevelopment" of
OL,19,Fits Valley Parade ground during his
OL,20,Feight years as chairman.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
