OL,4,ARichmond, 85, dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA City spokesperson added: "The
OL,7,Fthoughts of everyone at Bradford City
OL,8,FAFC are with Geoffrey's family and
OL,9,Ffriends at this difficult time."
